      "start_plus_years": 10,
      "end_minus_years": 0,
      "end_plus_years": 0,
      "note": "Start is the traditional date of Pachacuti's rise (AD 1438); radiocarbon models place Inca presence in Mendoza, Argentina at cal AD 1350–1440, so the build-up may be earlier. End is the Spanish entry into Cusco, 1533; Inca resistance continued."
